<p>The policies ensure:</p>
<ol>
<li>Users can only access their own notes (<code>SELECT</code>, <code>INSERT</code>, <code>UPDATE</code>, <code>DELETE</code>)</li>
<li>Shared notes are visible to authenticated users</li>
<li>Data access is enforced at the database level</li>
</ol>
